WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.606
How do you sort every

2
00:00:01.606 --> 00:00:02.970
climate on Earth?

3
00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:05.696
Wladimir Köppen used five capital

4
00:00:05.696 --> 00:00:06.880
letters.

5
00:00:07.231 --> 00:00:08.417
A for tropical,

6
00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:09.291
B for dry,

7
00:00:09.291 --> 00:00:11.067
C for warm temperate.

8
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:12.000
D for cold,

9
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.150
