10
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:14.837
and E for polar.

11
00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:17.346
India's west coast is A-m-w,

12
00:00:17.346 --> 00:00:19.340
monsoon with a short dry

13
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:23.107
season. Western Rajasthan is B-W-h-w,

14
00:00:23.107 --> 00:00:25.022
a hot desert.

15
00:00:25.378 --> 00:00:27.269
Köppen based it on temperature

16
00:00:27.269 --> 00:00:28.541
